[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m The vertices of triangle \( BPC \) are \( B(24, 0) \), \( P(x, y) \), and \( C(60, 0) \). The area is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 1020 = \frac{1}{2} \left| 24(y - 0) + x(0 - 0) + 60(0 - y) \right| = \frac{1}{2} \left| 24y - 60y \right| = \frac{1}{2} \left| -36y \right| = 18|y|
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Thus:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 1020 = 18|y| \Rightarrow |y| = \frac{1020}{18} = 56.\overline{6}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Since \( y = x^2 - 60x \), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m x^2 - 60x = \pm 56.\overline{6}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Solving \( x^2 - 60x = 56.\overline{6} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m x^2 - 60x - 56.\overline{6} = 0 \Rightarrow x = \frac{60 \pm \sqrt{3600 + 226.666...}}{2} = \frac{60 \pm \sqrt{3826.666...}}{2} = \frac{60 \pm 61.86}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Thus, \( x = 60.93 \) or \( x = -0.93 \).
