[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m      f(15) &= f(14) + f(13) = 610 + 377 = 987 \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m      f(16) &= f(15) + f(14) = 987 + 610 = 1597 \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m      \end{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 6. **Finding the Remainder:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m    - We need to find the remainder when \( f(16) = 1597 \) is divided by 1000:
