[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Thus, the expected number of regions into which these 27 line segments divide the disk is \(\boxed{17902}\).
