[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Sixteen chairs are arranged in a row. Eight people each select a chair in which to sit so that no person sits next to two other people. Let $N$ be the number of subsets of the 16 chairs that could be selected. Find the remainder when $N$ is divided by $1000$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
