[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[ R(n) = \frac{n(n+1)}{2} + 1 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m However, this formula assumes that no two lines are parallel and no three lines are concurrent. In our problem, we are dealing with a disk and not the entire plane, but the principle remains similar as long as we consider the lines as cuts.
