[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m Now, let's consider the point \( E \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m - \( BE = \text{side length from } B \text{ to } E \text{ (unknown directly, but we need to calculate it using the properties of the pentagon)} \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m - \( EC = 24 \)
