[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m - \( EA = 26 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m The sum of these distances is also \( 84 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
