[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m \[ \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ U \_ \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m We need to choose 8 out of these 9 gaps to place the \(S\)s. This is a classic "stars and bars" problem, but with a restriction that no two \(S\)s can be in the same gap.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=439428)[0m 
